<section class="statement" id="about" data-screen-label="Statement">
  <div class="statement-side" data-reveal>
    <p>(01) — Statement</p>
    <figure data-tile>
      <img src="/images/portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of James Carlo Rivera" />
    </figure>
  </div>

  <div class="statement-main">
    <p class="statement-copy" data-scroll-words>I build complete <HoverSwap word="systems" alternate="docker compose up -d — it just runs" /> for real operational problems — from the interface to the server they run on. Product decisions, <HoverSwap word="architecture" graph />, real users, and <HoverSwap word="interfaces" alternate="hover · focus · empty · error" /> careful enough that nobody notices the plumbing. Most of my projects started as an operational problem in a business I could actually walk into.</p>

    <div class="statement-stats" data-reveal>
      <div><strong data-count="1">00</strong><span>System in real operations</span></div>
      <div><strong data-count="3">00</strong><span>In development or ongoing</span></div>
      <div><strong>2027</strong><span>BSIT, PUP Sto. Tomas</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
